<title>法国多地10月17日爆发抗议活动，数万人因物价上涨和公共支出下降走上街头，同时表达对抗议学生的支持。警方与抗议者爆发冲突</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35702</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35702</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:07:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">法国多地10月17日爆发抗议活动，数万人因物价上涨和公共支出下降走上街头，同时表达对抗议学生的支持。警方与抗议者爆发冲突。<br/>在巴黎，有汽车和报刊亭被纵火，警方使用催泪瓦斯和水炮驱散暴力抗议者。但更多的和平抗议者高唱国歌、挥舞国旗进行游行。在里昂和马赛等地，有政府建筑物被纵火或破坏。<br/>截至下午，已有272人因暴力事件被捕。<br/>（<a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/students-trade-unions-yellow-vests-set-protest-across-france-2026-10-17/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">路透社</a>，<a href="https://apnews.com/article/france-school-protests-yellow-vest-44b9d3ba91ffad4029f975dced7e31cb" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/u47Sj3XWkfAyicO-ObXR2NtD-bYkgkbw3gLk7-0rxjJep5UHLZ0bm_8snmNX5u58kaQAwBbZ7w8yNMkIeZtjqza3g1Q1pinKzXpiei7MIe4W63zhdsbLJO_Fpm0uGwlZYi5X9Sb5iXOXKpB4AWMco3KFCDIUNy3w7lmooCGdJ0LAr_u3BP1ZEEChMjg1u455McBJRqDR55scBMALndrtUzoIDftlyVkTTGpZU3Wo_DXls-2e5wG1vSsGT2mWtAeEpEkL-fcTYfIcTfHfgW4zLNkwHN114Bi9ZRwjs3YZLbbeIz6yJTFNkdiZFFZXdu7S6KI09D0H5FGQkYqTcbrhxg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/iQISiVJN8wIpilnP8kXMWUoa5sNDPweovr9kdQa8gn9yUyDDBMES7iiniGBmL8ylKUZEKVThcdUruyiofK9QyxOyq5cyLaGC3MWFpeuTpqbexwnKRGp1UYVzA7NlGwv3YEUckyewK97yZL8gBsmRKQcHD885_y_O0FM-WFN-3BDaQyDx_mGs7g4CAqWO8KGGG7J8D12sM-HmE-oCQGFkuXxieI31SEaslTipjkbh_QzyjGy_pSL4rXxdHc1OtUK63_psRSfhCJVgYFeWy6Griny-PtF1hoRaFc01ALFnyabx7hwCz_WrsqnAazgxGllWTpcEeIP3wdh8n4wFcCH32g.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/qjWZkepm9NxNDzuBzv_yT4iJPlxmuXVjuNtRzuGIljz98mwsj289d_rZRckahtm2TA1sWYU1Cx6vdupBfpxMkrwGvr6yo-lAAFA0wD1AJVoboMMuhQsJ0MK7I68xOaN8jErjX1o59-L5OLqelKYWrOkbvoMmcHmGU0IjCKIJw3D7AVER6fULPlZ52c2gsUZ_5MPp8jMCUIU5jD5TunLRrnpY38i8eV3hxj5GE4v58zCBXtLLdH3bFGF9VPWICa4GanQX4zhAL5JC4q5a00KZNZWm9KWJw2YKUVS-skDWnDdo1NE71mGb4Socv52b5gA24Dy