<title>俄罗斯堪察加半岛北京时间10月16日11:35:31发生6.9级地震，震源深度135千米。日本气象厅一度将地震规模误报至</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35694</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35694</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 05:11:38 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">俄罗斯堪察加半岛北京时间10月16日11:35:31发生6.9级地震，震源深度135千米。<br/>日本气象厅一度将地震规模误报至9.9级，并针对北海道至东海地方几乎全域发布最大震度7的<a href="https://eew-history.dmdata.ne.jp/20261016123810" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">紧急地震速报</a>。约8分48秒后气象厅撤销了紧急地震速报，这也是紧急地震速报系统自2008年投入运行以来，首次撤销紧急地震速报“警报”的发布。<br/>此次地震日本实际录得最大震度1，在北海道函馆市。NHK北海道各放送局均未感受到明显摇晃。<br/>此次误报导致东海道新干线一度停运。JR东日本表示，东北新干线和在来线的运行未受此次紧急地震速报影响。<br/>日本气象厅在当地时间14时召开的记者会上表示，正在调查此次误报的详情，并否认系统遭受网络攻击。<br/>（<a href="https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/eventpage/us6000u2mq/executive" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美国地质调查局</a>，NHK <a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60368" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">1</a>，<a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60369" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">2</a>，<a href="https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/nd-20261016de60374" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">3</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/LNSC6MYtdYoplkS7MbTK-Aq4JYh6jrqF6ZOlWbmK-xnBIe9igN8sVkMnONNhwAkco1gxpGHvdugXPDSuy_XuxAnZ0iLApFVN07X_Ar65sPl2PzA12XLAgdJ-4l1EuaIeL9LTXHBznx0ItCifc0DPyO2qVV7s8eqNcnMTBzOmoJBHFapVtF4Zjg_WMUwDsR8-vpDAHwMQaRO9vq8a2cV5SyLWtOD0rrSep3zOwrbqhJTUWrn-2gCOmDXoiT315IClPOoWgo9gD1jxYwEc3hTyKMZOT2gogSD76w1qb4Rp_kvqQf7_6wrxgHRTBfZ5urOcdGXDVdNP9iPmO5wnSYBb3w.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/G1ljwWQAGklaxz_3rU7HBB0REevlNXG1TYcYMh9pwhDZVqX_LZ04tc0Qv9jimEM31B14tWZOa0t0IZxnwA52Mn9pQSvuO8nWaZLCJB8BwzyEcGAvdO7ZNQ0s2Gmowbgx5UtGJP5uMNTWHMj9SPMUzLLYj4Eb7uQBXh3GMtodG9Wv3n86dRYPOcSV5pIXGxGQbkncey28MyWt6mQSmm2fFOM07zP7Q-2zqJT3L07RtcSQOFTNJrKUh37cEoBS